					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭拉娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030725,
					"content": "「蘭那羅」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030726
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030726,
					"content": "欸？是說蘭那羅嗎？這麼一看，確實是之前我們看到的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730030715,
					"content": "蔬菜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030708,
					"content": "什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030709
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730030709,
					"content": "好像是說能抵抗無留陀侵蝕什麼的…名字很怪的東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730030710
